  <h2>How much does QMS software cost?</h2>
  <p>
    QMS software prices fall into two clear bands. Self-serve tools built for a single quality manager
    typically run from roughly $30 to $220 a month per user, billed by named seat. Enterprise eQMS platforms
    aimed at regulated manufacturing and life sciences start at $12,000 to $17,500 a year and climb from
    there, often with a separate implementation project on top. Figures below are publicly listed or commonly
    reported, checked in September 2026, with the source next to each one.
  </p>
